# dev-cli — modern developer command-line utilities (FETCHED-ONLINE, never
# baked). A curated set of fast, ergonomic CLI tools that complement the baked
# baseline (ripgrep/fd/fzf/bat/eza/lazygit already ship). All members are
# official-repo, so they install via pacman with no AUR build. `iictl pack
# remove dev-cli` -Rns's exactly this set.
#
# httpie ships as the official `httpie` package (the proposal's "python-httpie
# (httpie)" — `httpie` is the correct repo name; `python-httpie` is not a real
# package). All others are official-repo Rust/Go CLIs.
